# Local env files must never enter the build context: Vite inlines every
# VITE_* variable it finds into the client bundle at build time, and
# apps/miniapp/.env.local carries a signed dev initData that would then ship
# to production as a working auth bypass.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example

node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
.tools
.claude
*.bak-*
